---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Profile</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    I am an undergraduate researcher at IISER Thiruvananthapuram pursuing a BS-MS in i2 Mathematics. My academic and technical foundation lies at the intersection of Stochastic Processes, Optimization, and Reinforcement Learning. I am deeply focused on bridging rigorous mathematical frameworks with corporate business applications, specifically leveraging my background for High-Frequency Trading (HFT) modeling, quantitative finance, and robust market-making strategies.
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="BS-MS in Mathematics (Major: i2 Mathematics)"
      subtitle="August 2023 to May 2028 at IISER Thiruvananthapuram, Kerala, India"
    >
      GPA: 7.21/10.0. Honors: PM Yasasvi Scholar for Academic Excellence (Awarded from 2nd Year). Coursework includes Numerical Analysis, ODEs, Probability, Linear Algebra, and Optimization.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Higher Secondary Education (Science)"
      subtitle="August 2020 to May 2022 at Gyan Deep Sr. Sec. Public School, Uttar Pradesh, India"
    >
      Percentage: 95.4%.
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Experience & Research</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Summer Research Intern | Wadhwani School of Data Science and AI (WSAI)"
      subtitle="Summer 2026 at IIT Madras, Chennai, India"
    >
      Conducted computational research titled "Discerning ecological behaviour and interactions of minimal reactomes of the human gut," applying advanced data science methodologies to biological systems.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Reinforcement Learning for Market Making"
      subtitle="February 2026 to March 2026 (Independent Project)"
    >
      Engineered a Soft Actor-Critic (SAC) agent to optimize bid-ask spreads in a simulated Limit Order Book (LOB). Modeled inventory risk using asymmetric reward functions to manage stochastic price volatility. Benchmarked performance against classical Avellaneda-Stoikov strategies, achieving superior risk-adjusted returns.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Game Theory Reading Project"
      subtitle="December 2025 to January 2026 at IISER TVM"
    >
      Analyzed strategic decision-making and Nash equilibria in multi-agent competitive environments under the supervision of Prof. Sheetal. Explored payoff matrices and mathematical modeling of strategic interactions in economic contexts.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Classical-Quantum Hybrid Classifier"
      subtitle="October 2024 to November 2024 (Independent Project)"
    >
      Developed a novel hybrid protocol utilizing PCA and K-Means for reference centroid selection. Implemented a UUt quantum circuit to measure state overlap probability for non-linear classification, optimizing decision rules for near-term quantum hardware.
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Certifications & Conferences</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>
      <a href="#" target="_blank"> Mastering Deep Learning | IIM Bangalore (SWAYAM) - Jan 2025</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="#" target="_blank"> Intl. Conference on Computational & Applied Math - Dec 2025</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="#" target="_blank"> AI & ML Workshops | Deloitte, WEKA, IIT Madras - 2024-2025</a>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Technical Skills</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc md:columns-5 columns-2 mx-6 mb-10">
    <li>Python</li>
    <li>SQL</li>
    <li>R</li>
    <li>C++</li>
    <li>LaTeX</li>
    <li>PyTorch</li>
    <li>TensorFlow</li>
    <li>PennyLane</li>
    <li>Scikit-Learn</li>
    <li>Pandas</li>
    <li>NumPy</li>
    <li>Deep RL (SAC)</li>
    <li>Quantum ML</li>
    <li>Git / GitHub</li>
    <li>Jupyter / VS Code</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Interests & Pursuits</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li><strong>Horology & Mechanical Engineering:</strong> Researching high-end watch collections, deployment clasp mechanisms, and precision mechanics.</li>
    <li><strong>Behavioral Strategy & Corporate Communication:</strong> Analyzing public speaking eloquence, language acquisition, and high-level corporate business strategies.</li>
    <li><strong>Quantitative Personal Finance:</strong> Tracking active systematic investment plans (SIPs) and analyzing diverse financial instruments and equity markets.</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>